+# Proof outline — S5-CLM-00003497
+
+1. Replay the exact `Filter.Eventually` Ringel statement and its definitional transports (PU-00).
+2. Choose a uniform threshold and specialize to each finite tree (PU-01, PU-02).
+3. Construct the edge-disjoint embedding family and prove complete coverage (PU-03–PU-05).
+4. Compose the obligations into the eventual existential (PU-06).
+
+Step 3 is the unresolved large-n tree-decomposition theorem. The provider declaration is `sorryAx`-bearing and is excluded from the machine root. The handoff retains `PU-ROOT-OPEN` and does not claim theorem completion.

